ur back, cross one ankle over the opposite knee.":"988206b36223.ogg","Draw the bottom leg toward you until you feel the outer hip open.":"5d3718d054e7.ogg","A gentler pigeon. Perfect for sore glutes and bedtime.":"3b7805317fce.ogg","Get ready. First up: Neck Side Stretch, Left side.":"bc56836c90a7.ogg","Next: Neck Side Stretch, Left side.":"478a544a9145.ogg","Get ready. First up: Neck Side Stretch, Right side.":"299f05218021.ogg","Next: Neck Side Stretch, Right side.":"1c5d517e4bb4.ogg","Tilt your ear toward your shoulder and rest your hand lightly on your head.":"97483a301cd4.ogg","Let the other arm hang heavy and reach your fingers toward the floor.":"0a182caf2f9a.ogg","Don't pull. The weight of your hand is enough.":"47ab6f90f83b.ogg","Get ready. First up: Cross-Body Shoulder Stretch, Left side.":"339d5337614d.ogg","Next: Cross-Body Shoulder Stretch, Left side.":"e9524d8af6db.ogg","Get ready. First up: Cross-Body Shoulder Stretch, Right side.":"636c314057ed.ogg","Next: Cross-Body Shoulder Stretch, Right side.":"95366b43777e.ogg","Bring one arm straight across your chest.":"ef54342056bf.ogg","Hug it closer with the other hand, just above the elbow.":"9becf1cdb402.ogg","Keep your shoulder down, away from your ear.":"1ca8bcbfc39c.ogg","Get ready. First up: Overhead Triceps Stretch, Left side.":"ac75b769cba8.ogg","Next: Overhead Triceps Stretch, Left side.":"c17325838ce5.ogg","Get ready. First up: Overhead Triceps Stretch, Right side.":"eb924f294d20.ogg","Next: Overhead Triceps Stretch, Right side.":"39ca670cedef.ogg","Reach one arm up, bend the elbow and let your hand drop behind your head.":"f627555a5183.ogg","With the other hand, gently press the elbow back.":"dc8abd3ead05.ogg","Stand tall and keep breathing.":"7d4a49b061c9.ogg","Get ready. First up: Standing Chest Opener.":"160c4477b4a7.ogg","Next: Standing Chest Opener.":"4aabd19bd0d6.ogg","Clasp your hands behind your back.":"59f66dd201ed.ogg","Squeeze your shoulder blades together and lift your chest.":"608037